            <div class="cf-bkd-row"><span class="cf-bkd-lbl">Total net volume</span><span class="cf-bkd-val" id="cf-total-net">—</span></div>
            <div class="cf-bkd-row"><span class="cf-bkd-lbl">+ Waste</span><span class="cf-bkd-val" id="cf-waste-amt">—</span></div>
            <div class="cf-bkd-row"><span class="cf-bkd-lbl">→ Order this amount</span><span class="cf-bkd-val" id="cf-order">—</span></div>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size:.74rem;color:#64748b;">*Always verify footing depth meets your local frost line requirement before pouring.</p>
        </div>
